  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_3551.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La dise&ntilde;adora gallega, afincada en Vila-real e integrante de Onda Factory 2014, Antia Ferreiro, ha presentado en La Terrasseta de Lola sus modelos por primera vez en la ciudad donde resdide. Trajes elegantes, de fiesta y camisetas compon&iacute;an la colecci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3511.jpg\" alt=\"img_3511\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3514.jpg\" alt=\"img_3514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3517.jpg\" alt=\"img_3517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3519.jpg\" alt=\"img_3519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3521.jpg\" alt=\"img_3521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3522.jpg\" alt=\"img_3522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3523.jpg\" alt=\"img_3523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirovila-real310714/img_3524.jpg\" alt=\"img_3524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/desfiladaantiaferreirov